# Serper setup guide

## Recommended env value
```bash
ASTRA_SERPER_API_KEY=your_serper_key
```

## What it powers
- `/api/search`
- `/api/chat` source enrichment when web search is enabled
- `/api/opportunities-refresh`
- `npm run feed:refresh`

## Tip
Serper generally gives better search results than the public DuckDuckGo fallback.
